  "description": "Quantropic.Toolkit is a set of functional primitives for C#: Result Monad for type-safe handling of operations and errors, Maybe for safe handling of optional values, and a validator based on Guard Clauses. The library helps you write clean, expressive, and error-resistant code without relying on exceptions for control flow. All types are immutable and thread-safe.",
